label Siren
if {done} == true:
	jump calibration/last
else:
	siren: ...an you not hear me?
	siren: Can you tell me your ID number?
	green: GN-354
	siren: Hello GN-354! I'm SN-274, your direct supervisor and network mate.
	siren: You may call me Siren.
	[signal arg="respond"]
	[end_timeline]
	label Siren_response
	if {response} == "right":
		green: Hello!
		siren: So polite!
	elif {response} == "neutral":
		green: Hi.
		siren: It's nice to meet you!
	else:
		green: ...
		siren: Don't be shy!
	siren: Let's start with some calibration tests. I'm sure your knowledge base has already supplied you-
	green: my what?
	siren: -with all of the relevant information on who we are and what we do here!
	jump calibration/
	[end_timeline]